 via FIX\",\"href\":\"/exchange/api-reference/unified-fix/slr\"},{\"title\":\"Instrument List\",\"tag\":\"FIX\",\"description\":\"Instrument parameters and status response via FIX\",\"href\":\"/exchange/api-reference/unified-fix/sl\"},{\"title\":\"Market Data Request\",\"tag\":\"FIX\",\"description\":\"Subscribe to market data streams via FIX\",\"href\":\"/exchange/api-reference/unified-fix/mdr\"},{\"title\":\"Market Data Request Reject\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"MD Request Reject\",\"tag\":\"FIX\",\"description\":\"Rejection of a market data subscription request via FIX\",\"href\":\"/exchange/api-reference/unified-fix/mdrr\"},{\"title\":\"Market Data Snapshot Full Refresh\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"MD Snapshot Full Refresh\",\"tag\":\"FIX\",\"description\":\"Full order book snapshot via FIX\",\"href\":\"/exchange/api-reference/unified-fix/mdsfr\"},{\"title\":\"Market Data Incremental Refresh\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"MD Incremental Refresh\",\"tag\":\"FIX\",\"description\":\"Incremental order book and trade updates via FIX\",\"href\":\"/exchange/api-reference/unified-fix/mdir\"},{\"title\":\"News\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"News\",\"tag\":\"FIX\",\"description\":\"News via FIX\",\"href\":\"/exchange/api-reference/unified-fix/news\"},{\"title\":\"Trading Session Status Request\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Session Status Request\",\"tag\":\"FIX\",\"description\":\"Request trading session status via FIX (Spot only)\",\"href\":\"/exchange/api-reference/unified-fix/tssr\"},{\"title\":\"Trading Session Status\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Session Status\",\"tag\":\"FIX\",\"description\":\"Trading session status response via FIX (Spot only)\",\"href\":\"/exchange/api-reference/unified-fix/tss\"}]},{\"group\":\"Session\",\"public\":true,\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Header \u0026 Trailer\",\"tag\":\"FIX\",\"description\":\"Standard FIX message header and trailer fields\",\"href\":\"/exchange/api-reference/unified-fix/header-trailer\"},{\"title\":\"Logon\",\"tag\":\"FIX\",\"description\":\"Authenticate and establish a F